  "description": "FactoorSharp.FacturX.PDF adds PDF/A-3 support for FactoorSharp, enabling the creation and processing of Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) documents with embedded XML invoice data.\n\nIt is designed for applications that require hybrid electronic invoices combining PDF and structured formats such as Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) and XRechnung.\n\nUse this package together with FactoorSharp.FacturX when working with PDF-based electronic invoices.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
