  "published": "2026-10-10T20:27:19.783Z",
  "releaseNotes": "20.0.0\n* BREAKING: SaveToPdf()/SaveToPdfAsync() return PdfSaveResult and accept an optional InvoiceFormatOptions parameter (binary incompatible, recompile)\n* BREAKING: the generated PDF declares PDF/A-3B instead of PDF/A-3A\n* PdfSaveResult lists repaired and unresolved problems of the source PDF (PdfSourceIssue)\n* Source PDFs are sanitized for PDF/A: annotation flags, missing fonts, /Encoding of symbolic TrueType fonts\n* InvoiceFormatOptions now apply to the XML embedded by SaveToPdf()\n* Updated dependency to core library 20.0.0",
